{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01565","headline":"琴曲歌辞  秋思二首 一 · 王涯","name":"琴曲歌辞  秋思二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"网轩凉吹动轻衣，夜听更长玉漏稀。\n月渡天河光转湿，鹊惊秋树叶频飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}